CONTRIBUTOR IS LIABLE FOR DAMAGES ARISING FROM THE COVERED WORK OR THIS
LICENSE, INCLUDING LOST DATA, LOST PROFITS, BUSINESS INTERRUPTION, OR
INDIRECT, SPECIAL, INCIDENTAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES.

11. Scope and version

Rights not expressly granted are reserved. Only this exact version
applies; publication of a later license does not automatically replace
